{"seq":3,"slug":"parallel-sampling","title":"并行采样与 beam：一个 prompt，多条命运","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/paged-attention-serving/sharing/parallel-sampling","wordCount":1425,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"并行采样与-beam-一个-prompt-多条命运\">并行采样与 beam：一个 prompt，多条命运</h1><p>前缀共享省的是「不同请求之间」的重复；这一篇讲的并行采样和 beam search，省的是「同一个请求内部」的重复。当你对一个 prompt 要生成 5 个候选回答（并行采样），或维护 4 条候选路径择优（beam search），这些分支共享着完全相同的 prompt——甚至一段公共的生成前缀。分页 + 写时复制让它们共用同一批物理块，直到真正分叉才各走各路。这是 PagedAttention 在请求内部对写时复制的直接应用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-树形的生成结构\">核心概念：树形的生成结构</h2><p>并行采样和 beam search 都可以画成一棵树：树根是共享的 prompt，从某处开始分叉成多个分支，每个分支是一条候选序列。传统连续分配无法表达这种结构——它只能给每条分支各分一整段 KV，于是 prompt 部分被复制 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 份，白白浪费。分页天然适配树形：让所有分支的块表在 prompt 段指向同一批物理块，分叉后才各自追加新块。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[prompt KV&lt;br/&gt;所有分支共享一批块] --&gt; B[分支 1]&#10;  A --&gt; C[分支 2]&#10;  A --&gt; D[分支 3]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[各自的新块]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[各自的新块]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[各自的新块]&#10;  A -.ref_cnt = 分支数.-&gt; A\">flowchart TD\n  A[prompt KV&lt;br/&gt;所有分支共享一批块] --&gt; B[分支 1]\n  A --&gt; C[分支 2]\n  A --&gt; D[分支 3]\n  B --&gt; B1[各自的新块]\n  C --&gt; C1[各自的新块]\n  D --&gt; D1[各自的新块]\n  A -.ref_cnt = 分支数.-&gt; A</pre><p>fork 一个分支，本质就是复制块表、给共享块的引用计数加一，几行足矣：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def fork(parent):&#10;    child = new_sequence()&#10;    child.block_table = parent.block_table.copy()  # 复制映射，不复制数据&#10;    for phys in child.block_table:&#10;        ref_cnt[phys] += 1                          # 共享块引用数加一&#10;    return child   # 此后 child 写新 token 时由 CoW 按需复制边界块\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fork</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(parent):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    child </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> new_sequence()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    child.block_table </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> parent.block_table.copy()  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 复制映射，不复制数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> phys </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> child.block_table:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ref_cnt[phys] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                          # 共享块引用数加一</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> child   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 此后 child 写新 token 时由 CoW 按需复制边界块</span></span></code></pre></div><p>共享的实现完全复用前面两篇的机制：prompt 块被多个分支的块表引用，引用计数等于分支数；哪个分支要写自己的新 token，就靠写时复制在需要时复制边界块，见 <a href=\"copy-on-write\">写时复制</a>。所以并行采样不是新机制，而是 CoW 在「一个请求 fork 出多个序列」时的具体用法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"并行采样-n-个独立样本\">并行采样：n 个独立样本</h2><p>并行采样（在 API 里通常是 <code>n&gt;1</code> 参数）要求对同一 prompt 独立采样出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个输出，用于给用户多个选项、或做后续重排。它的树结构最简单：一个共享根（prompt），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个从根直接分出的平行分支，分支之间互不影响。</p>\n<p>内存账很直接。设 prompt 长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>、每个输出平均长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span></span>、共 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个样本。不共享时总 KV 正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n(P+O)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>；共享 prompt 后，prompt 只存一份，总量降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P + nO</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span></span>。节省率为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>节省</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{节省} = \\frac{n(P+O) - (P + nO)}{n(P+O)} = \\frac{(n-1)P}{n(P+O)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">节省</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 prompt 远长于输出（例如长文档 + 短摘要的多候选生成），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>≫</mo><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P \\gg O</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span></span>，节省逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{n-1}{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>——生成 8 个候选能省下近 7 份 prompt 的 KV。这份节省又直接转化为更大的批量、更高的吞吐，见 <a href=\"../practice/throughput-gains\">吞吐提升与度量</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"beam-search-分支会死也会生\">Beam search：分支会死也会生</h2><p>Beam search 比并行采样复杂，因为它的树是<strong>动态</strong>的：每一步，所有当前候选束扩展出下一个 token 的多种可能，按累计概率保留 top-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 条，淘汰其余。这意味着束会分叉（一条束衍生多条），也会消亡（低分束被剪掉），树结构每步都在变。</p>\n<p>分页对这种动态结构的处理格外优雅。束分叉时，新束的块表复制父束的映射、共享其全部历史块（引用计数增加），只有当它写新 token 触及未满的边界块时才 CoW 复制。束消亡时，遍历它的块表把引用计数减一，某物理块归零则回收——而仍被别的束引用的块安然无恙。整套操作都在块表和引用计数上完成，物理块本身极少真正拷贝。</p>\n<p>下表对比两种采样在分页视角下的特征：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>并行采样 (n&gt;1)</th>\n<th>Beam search</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>树结构</td>\n<td>静态，根分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 支</td>\n<td>动态，逐步分叉与剪枝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分支间关系</td>\n<td>完全独立</td>\n<td>竞争，共享公共前缀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>共享部分</td>\n<td>仅 prompt</td>\n<td>prompt + 公共生成前缀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要机制</td>\n<td>共享 + CoW</td>\n<td>共享 + CoW + 引用计数回收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存节省</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{(n-1)P}{n(P+O)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.53em;vertical-align:-0.52em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.52em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>更高（生成段也共享）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"为什么连续分配做不到\">为什么连续分配做不到</h2><p>把连续分配放到这些场景里，就能看清分页的不可替代。连续分配下，每条分支必须占一整段连续显存，prompt 被物理复制 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 份；beam search 里束的分叉与剪枝更是灾难——分叉要整段拷贝一份历史，剪枝留下的空洞加剧外部碎片，见 <a href=\"../foundations/kv-fragmentation\">KV 内存碎片之痛</a>。结果是候选数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 稍大，显存就顶不住，beam width 被迫压得很小。</p>\n<p>分页把「共享一份历史 + 只在分叉处复制」变成常态，让大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>、宽 beam 在同样显存下成为可能。这也解释了一个现象：在支持 PagedAttention 的引擎上开高并行采样或宽 beam，显存增长远比朴素预期平缓——因为增长的只有各分支真正独有的那部分。这份能力最终服务于连续批处理把 GPU 喂满的目标，见 <a href=\"../practice/continuous-batching\">连续批处理</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>并行采样与 beam search 的生成结构是树：共享根（prompt/公共前缀）+ 多条分支。</li>\n<li>分页让所有分支的块表在共享段指向同一批物理块，靠引用计数与写时复制在分叉处复制。</li>\n<li>并行采样是静态树，仅共享 prompt，节省率约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{(n-1)P}{n(P+O)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.53em;vertical-align:-0.52em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.52em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，prompt 越长越省。</li>\n<li>Beam search 是动态树，束会分叉也会剪枝，共享延伸到公共生成前缀，全在块表/引用计数上完成。</li>\n<li>连续分配须复制整段历史、剪枝制造碎片，逼小 beam；分页让大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>、宽 beam 在同显存下可行。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h3><ul>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"copy-on-write\">写时复制</a> — 分支分叉时的复制机制</li>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"prefix-sharing\">前缀共享 (系统提示)</a> — 跨请求的对偶场景</li>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"../practice/continuous-batching\">连续批处理</a> — 省下的显存如何被用满</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../llm-serving-inference-systems/optimization/paged-attention\">LLM 推理服务系统 · 分页注意力</a> — 服务系统里的采样支持</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"并行采样与 beam：一个 prompt，多条命运","id":"并行采样与-beam-一个-prompt-多条命运"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：树形的生成结构","id":"核心概念-树形的生成结构"},{"level":2,"text":"并行采样：n 个独立样本","id":"并行采样-n-个独立样本"},{"level":2,"text":"Beam search：分支会死也会生","id":"beam-search-分支会死也会生"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么连续分配做不到","id":"为什么连续分配做不到"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":3,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"前缀共享：一段系统提示只算一次","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/paged-attention-serving/sharing/prefix-sharing"},"next":{"title":"连续批处理：把省下的显存立刻用满","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/paged-attention-serving/practice/continuous-batching"}}